      "en": "The spirits of the prophets are subject to the prophets,",
      "ko": "예언하는 자들의 영이 예언하는 자들에게 제재를 받나니",
      "source_text_hash": "003e9a06327c1b628e8316157a243e2c3bf74a01951557817f96556dff16bfac",
      "translation_text_hash": "3f4120ce71cf6af74eb9a30089850e93e6042a28da94728b4ea7714577775bc1",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
