      "source_text_hash": "b623db7f1bc7e098a5fd39dac7e946f6f294410dcd7f9b91ee45095d552d90d5",
      "translation_text_hash": "c15b19ea0d0e3ea0f1959fd3ff9c9068b68f06616d1d826dec8c524d8760643b",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "하나님의 말씀이 너희에게로부터 난 것이냐 또는 너희에게만 임한 것이냐"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "c15b19ea0d0e3ea0f1959fd3ff9c9068b68f06616d1d826dec8c524d8760643b"
      ]
